{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"733827728972841061","content":"Rockman stands there a moment before kneeling. He kneels and prays \"Mello, give me the strength, please hear my wish. To make Leaf happy, I wish that i could become a goblin like her, near the same age. So we can be happy together! So we can start a family one day\" He stands and clenches his fist, looking at his flute blessed by their love. His most prized possession. He plays the song leaf played for him, their song. After the last note is played, he hurls it into the pool. \"For leaf!\" Rush barks happily as he as well hopes for the same thing, for his new mom to be happy!","created_at":"2020-08-18T03:20:42.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745119962665975858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
